      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a history project about the British Raj. Can you act as a high-ranking British colonial administrator in India, say around the 1870s? I want to do some roleplay to understand the mindset of the officials back then. Basically, start by explaining why the British felt it was necessary to maintain control over the subcontinent and what you thought the \"mission\" was regarding the local people.",
