    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense from your perspective. You mentioned \"civilizing\" them and bringing \"order.\" When you're out in the field or dealing with the local populations, what are your actual impressions of them? Like, how do you personally view the character or the intellect of the locals compared to the British? Do you find them capable of handling these new systems you're bringing?",
