      "content": "I see. So you're essentially saying they're not quite on the same level of development as the British. It sounds like you're describing a natural hierarchy where certain groups are just inherently more suited for leadership and logic, right? In your view, is there a specific reason why they lack that rational discipline, or is it just a fundamental difference in their nature?",
